   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Initiative for Human Rights, Democracy and the Rule of Law</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through its Global Initiative for Human Rights, Democracy and the Rule of Law program 2025&#x2013;2029, CRD seeks to address the urgent challenges facing human rights defenders (HRDs) and civil society organisations (CSOs) globally. CRD&#x2019;s Theory of Change envisions a world with democratic societies where everyone enjoys civil and political rights. Our approach focuses on capacity development, strengthening civil society, and promoting human rights. CRD&#x2019;s 2023&#x2013;2030 strategy is built on four pillars&#x2014;Security, Capacity, Engagement, and Accountability. These pillars guide all activities within the program, from emergency support and security training to capacity development, advocacy, and legal assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
